{"sha": "0dee6206421dc06cefa0ec801daf045f651ceb30ef476085b871d432c8b97166", "body": ["\\begin{remark}[级数的下一站]", "本章为本册的分析收尾，并打开三扇", "门。在本科二年级分册中，级数获得了一个变量（$\\sum", "a_n x^n$：幂级数及其收敛半径），然后", "发展出以函数为对象的理论（傅里叶级数）；绝对收敛与条件收敛的二分，", "在下面的周末问题中得到生动体现，", "将成为二者共同的基石。在概率论", "（本科三年级分册）中，离散随机变量的期望", "\\emph{就是}级数，而绝对收敛正是", "使它们得以良定义的条件。而黎曼级数 $\\sum n^{-s}$，", "推广到复数 $s$ 时，便成为 ζ 函数 --- 数学中被研究得最多的", "一个级数。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:1}", "判断下列级数的敛散性（若可裂项相消，则求其和）：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\geq1} \\frac{1}{n(n+1)},", "\\qquad", "\\sum_{n\\geq2} \\ln\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{1}{n^2}\\Bigr),", "\\qquad", "\\sum_{n\\geq0} \\frac{3^n + 4^n}{5^n} .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:2}", "判断下列级数的敛散性：$\\;\\sum \\dfrac{n^2}{2^n}$；$\\;\\sum \\dfrac{n!}{n^n}$；", "$\\;\\sum \\dfrac{2^n\\,n!}{n^n}$；$\\;\\sum \\dfrac{3^n\\,n!}{n^n}$。", "\\emph{（比值判别法；回忆 $\\bigl(1 + \\frac1n\\bigr)^n \\to \\eu$。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:3}", "判断下列级数的敛散性：$\\;\\sum \\sin\\dfrac{1}{n^2}$；$\\;\\sum", "\\Bigl(1 - \\cos\\dfrac1n\\Bigr)$；$\\;\\sum \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n(n+1)}}$；", "$\\;\\sum \\dfrac{\\ln n}{n^2}$ \\emph{（与 $n^{-3/2}$ 比较）}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:4}", "证明 $\\sum_{n\\geq1} \\frac{1}{n^2}$ 收敛，且其和 $\\leq 2$，", "利用 $\\frac{1}{n^2} \\leq \\frac{1}{n(n-1)}$（$n \\geq 2$），并", "借助裂项相消给出上界。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:5}", "判断下列级数的敛散性：$\\;\\sum \\dfrac{(-1)^n}{\\sqrt n}$，$\\;\\sum", "\\dfrac{(-1)^n}{n + (-1)^n}$ \\emph{（先展开：交错级数判别法", "不能直接应用 --- 为什么？）}，以及 $\\;\\sum", "\\sin\\bigl(\\pi\\sqrt{n^2+1}\\,\\bigr)$ \\emph{（模 $\\pi$ 约化：", "$\\sqrt{n^2+1} = n + \\frac{1}{2n} + O(n^{-3})$）}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:6}", "对哪些 $\\alpha > 0$，级数 $\\sum_{n \\geq 2}", "\\dfrac{1}{n (\\ln n)^{\\alpha}}$ 收敛？\\emph{（积分比较法；", "作代换 $u = \\ln t$。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:7}", "设 $u_n = \\dfrac{1}{n} - \\ln\\Bigl(1 + \\dfrac1n\\Bigr)$。证明", "$0 \\leq u_n \\leq \\dfrac{1}{2n^2}$，$\\sum u_n$ 收敛，并", "由此推出欧拉常数\\index{欧拉常数}的存在性：", "\\[", "\\gamma = \\lim_{N \\to \\infty} \\Bigl( \\sum_{n=1}^{N} \\frac 1n - \\ln N", "\\Bigr) .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:8}", "求下列级数的和：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{n(n+2)}", "\\qquad\\text{和}\\qquad", "\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{n}{2^n} .", "\\]", "\\emph{（第一题用部分分式。第二题：先求", "$\\sum_{n=1}^{N} n x^{n-1}$ 的闭式，再令 $N \\to \\infty$，", "在 $x = \\frac12$ 处。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:9}", "（柯西凝聚判别法）设 $(u_n)$ 非负且单调递减。", "证明", "\\[", "\\sum_{n \\geq 1} u_n \\text{ 收敛}", "\\iff", "\\sum_{k \\geq 0} 2^k\\, u_{2^k} \\text{ 收敛},", "\\]", "通过比较相邻 $2$ 的幂之间的各组项。", "由此推出黎曼判别法，以及", "\\cref{exo:b1:series:6}。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:10}", "利用\\cref{ex:b1:series:ln2}中的积分恒等式，", "将其改用于 $\\frac{1}{1+t^2}$，证明莱布尼茨公式", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi}{4} = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{(-1)^n}{2n+1}", "= 1 - \\frac13 + \\frac15 - \\frac17 + \\cdots", "\\]", "并给出误差界 $\\abs{R_N} \\leq \\frac{1}{2N+3}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:series:11}", "判断 $\\displaystyle\\sum_{n \\geq 1} \\frac{1}{n^{1 + 1/n}}$ 的敛散性。", "\\emph{（求 $n^{1/n}$ 的极限，并求通项的等价量：", "黎曼判别法需要一个\\emph{固定}的", "指数。）}", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}